get.description:
Polls one owned Shopee Product Page Hoarder task and returns its JSON result when ready. `result` is populated only when `status == "completed"`; it holds the full product detail page (attributes, models, description, and dozens more sections).

**Result data** (`result`, trimmed):
```json
{
  "collected_at": 1758006720,
  "error": null,
  "data": {
    "item": {
      "item_id": 40869177342,
      "shop_id": 34907167,
      "title": "Apple iPhone 15 - Garansi Resmi",
      "brand": "Apple",
      "currency": "IDR",
      "item_rating": {"rating_star": 4.92},
      "shop_location": "KOTA MEDAN"
    },
    "product_price": {"price": {"single_value": 1327000000000}}
  }
}
```

[Download full example (JSON)](https://data.magpieiq.com/samples/scraping/shopee-product-page.json)

