Returns the current status and per-URL results when complete. This endpoint only gets processed during working hours (Monday-Friday, 08:00-17:00 Asia/Jakarta / WIB).

Region is auto-detected from each URL's host (e.g. `shopee.co.id` → `id`, `shopee.com.br` → `br`). Each successful item's `download_url` points at `GET /v1/shopee/pgnt/jobs/{job_id}/items/{item_token}/data` and returns items from both `rcmd_items` (recommended/active) and `sold_out_items` (if any).

**Result data** (one shop URL's downloaded result, trimmed):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "total_shops": 4,
  "total_items": 6,
  "errors": [],
  "shops": {
    "https://shopee.co.id/shop/24843249": {
      "page_url": "https://shopee.co.id/shop/24843249",
      "page_type": "shop",
      "items": {"items": [], "total_fetched": 0, "total_count": 0, "has_more": true},
      "sold_out_items": {"items": []},
      "rcmd_items": {
        "items": [
          {
            "itemid": 40011228763,
            "shopid": 24843249,
            "name": "Lifetime N3TFLXX Premium UHD 4K Akun Netflix",
            "price": 800000000,
            "stock": 1,
            "sold": 1000
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
```

[Download full example (JSON)](https://data.magpieiq.com/samples/scraping/shopee-merchant-items.json)

Returns aggregate counts (total/success/failed/pending) and a single batch-level `download_url` for the compiled JSONL file once ready.

While scraping is in progress, `status` is `processing` and `download_url` is null. After all items reach a terminal state, the Windmill flow compiles individual result JSON files into a single gzip-compressed JSONL file. If the JSONL is not yet present, `status` remains `processing` with `message` set to `merging_results`. Once the JSONL is available, `download_url` contains a 24-hour signed URL.

Responses are cached: 120 seconds while processing, 24 hours once the JSONL is ready.

**Result data** (one JSONL line, trimmed):
```json
{
  "product_key": "no-void-minds-formlock-oversized-t-shirt-core",
  "shop_domain": "novoidminds",
  "response": {
    "data": {
      "product": {
        "basic": {"sku": "NVM-FLK-001", "isKreasiLokal": true},
        "brand": {"name": "NO VOID MINDS", "isActive": true}
      },
      "shopInfo": {
        "result": {
          "goldOS": {"isGold": true, "title": "Power Merchant"},
          "location": "Jakarta Barat",
          "shopCore": {"domain": "novoidminds", "name": "NO VOID MINDS"}
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

